  "question": {
    "text": "The current <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> in an inductance coil varies with time according to the graph given in the figure.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0009_e35ae8a85896.jpg\" style=\"height: 140px; width: 160px;\" /><br />\r<br />\rWhich one of the following graphs gives the variation of voltage with time across the inductor?"
  },
  "options": [
